I have followed the installaion document to install methylkit:

========================================================
# methylKit is currently on the development brach of bioconductor.
# So you are suggested to install as it is instructed in github not via bioconducor biocLite()

# Install required package:

sudo apt-get install libssl-dev
sudo apt-get install libcurl4-openssl-dev
Then start an R shell with sudo R and:

install.packages('httr')
install.packages('git2r')
install.packages('devtools')

# Install methylKit
library(devtools)
install_github("al2na/methylKit", build_vignettes=FALSE,
  repos=BiocInstaller::biocinstallRepos(),
  dependencies=TRUE)
if this doesn't work, you might need to add type="source" argument.
