Could you please post a session info of your R session?

To your question, I don't think you did run out of memory, but in order to solve your error we need a small reproducible example as Altuna said. As I have searched for similar errors I found that they mostly occurred two years ago, so I think some of your installed packages might be outdated, but that again we will see when we get more information of your R installation.

Best,

Alex

